/Multiplication
/01 C = 0
/02 if A = 0 then go to line 06
/03 C = C + B
/04 A = A - 1
/05 go to line 02
/06 halt
/4 times 3
Clear
Store Sum
Input
Store X
Input
Store counter
Loop,       Load counter
            Skipcond 400    /如果等于0，就跳过下一行
            Jump times
            Jump endAndOutput

times,      Load Sum
            Add X
            Store Sum
            Load counter
            Subt One
            Store counter
            Jump Loop

endAndOutput,   Load Sum
                Output
                Halt
counter,    dec 0
X,          dec 0
Sum,        dec 0
One,        dec 1